From: Dubzer <me@dubzer.dev>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:17:25 +0300
Subject: Open attachment photos at up to 1920px

Decode attachment photos at up to 1920px when opening them, which
avoids decoding and uploading full-size camera photos and their
preloaded neighbors. Smaller images such as screenshots are unaffected.
Request the normal full-size viewer image when the user zooms in or
starts editing, keeping the preview visible until it is ready and
deferring editing until loading completes.

Preserve zoom through asynchronous image replacement, retain already
edited bitmaps, and clear preview state when the photo changes or the
viewer closes or is destroyed.
